{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105290","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210529001:1":{"text":"콜록, 콜록콜록!","source_cn":"咳、咳咳咳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2551F5F917AAF195","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210529002:1":{"text":"아버지가 졌어요.","source_cn":"你输了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E54565BD0AFA7FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210529003:1":{"text":"소니아, 날 죽이려는 거냐?","source_cn":"索尼娅，你要杀了我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757508617C25ACE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210529004:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210529005:1":{"text":"난 너의 “아버지”다... 그때 내가 널 구하지 않았더라면 넌 해변에서 네 동생처럼 죽었을 거야.","source_cn":"我是你的“父亲”……当年，如果不是我把你救起，你早就死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC73C622C1756AC0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210529006:1":{"text":"알고 있어요.","source_cn":"我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB188B8685FB0426C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210529007:1":{"text":"난 널 친자식처럼 길렀어. 네게 검술을 가르치고, 학교에 보내고... 심지어는 블러디 로즈까지 네게 맡겼는데, 그런 나를 처단한다면 넌 영원히 민심을 잃게 될 게야.","source_cn":"我把你当亲生孩子一样养大，教你剑术，让你上学……甚至还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27E2299C450B3A00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210529008:1":{"text":"기억나느냐? 내가 블러디 로즈를 네 가슴에 달아주고 모두에게 너는 내 “딸”이라고 했던 것 말이다. 너도 영원한 충성을 내게 약속했었지.","source_cn":"还记得吗？我把血薇别在你胸口，告诉所有人，你就是我的“...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF275628B24D43C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210529009:1":{"text":"잊지 않았어요.","source_cn":"没忘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x663CF830BBC86C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210529010:1":{"text":"내... 내 딸아. 네가 날 죽일 리가 없어, 죽일 수도 없을 테고. 인정하거라.","source_cn":"我的……我的孩子。你不可能杀我，你也杀不了我。认命吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75297F6DEC6B6F59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210529011:1":{"text":"아버지...","source_cn":"父亲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968A077B58AA7863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210529012:1":{"text":"설마, 소니아, 여기에 넘어간다고?","source_cn":"不是吧，索尼娅，你吃这套？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC002211A1692C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210529013:1":{"text":"테시오가 당신을 가족으로 생각한다는 걸 믿는 거야? 차라리 나랑 루카가 헤어진 지 몇 년 된 형제라는 걸 믿지그래?","source_cn":"你相信泰西欧当你是亲人？还是信我和卢卡是失散多年的亲兄弟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D71ECC3716F0A22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210529014:1":{"text":"누가 네 형제라는 거야?","source_cn":"谁是你兄弟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C8A0111D692ABF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210529015:1":{"text":"시끄러워. 루카, 그에게 수갑을 채워.","source_cn":"真啰嗦。卢卡，铐上他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F24B98342068D10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210529016:1":{"text":"네. ","source_cn":"是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46CC2E142C5C636F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1210529017:0":{"text":"소니아?! 네가?! 감히 천한 부하 놈에게 나를 건드리게 해?!","source_cn":"——你？！索尼娅？！你竟然让手下碰我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00F4F67716672BD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1210529018:1":{"text":"아아아, 이 늙은이에게 수갑을 채우라는 거였구먼? 하하하하!","source_cn":"原来是给这老东西上铐？哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA08EF50BC5EE6E59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1210529019:1":{"text":"아버지, 아버지도 나이가 드시면서 말이 많아지셨어요. 눈도 안 좋아지셨고요.","source_cn":"父亲大人，你真的老了，变唠叨了，而且眼神也不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x935603B770632451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1210529020:1":{"text":"똑똑히 보세요! 저, 소니아는 누구의 자식도 아닙니다.","source_cn":"看清楚！我，索尼娅，不是谁的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66226F16D0C1C266","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1210529021:1":{"text":"전 블러디 로즈의 두목이에요. 당신이 죽은 뒤에 말이죠.","source_cn":"我是血薇帮的老大——在你死后。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC141A8564ECD59D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1210529022:1":{"text":"네가 감히...!","source_cn":"你竟敢——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC734E413241FCCDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1210529023:1":{"text":"그해, 러스트 항은 횡포를 부리는 해적들이 너무 많아서 사람들이 저마다 이곳을 떠나려고 했죠.","source_cn":"当年，锈锚港海盗横行，很多人想离开锈锚港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x700E431B9AF9A52C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1210529024:1":{"text":"그래서 당신은 해난을 계획했어요. 사람을 시켜 돛대를 부러뜨리고, 배에 폭탄을 묶어 사람들이 일부러 위기에 처하게 했죠. 블러디 로즈가 그들의 구원자처럼 보이게 하려고 말이죠.","source_cn":"于是你策划了一场海难，你让人磨断了桅杆，船舱里绑了炸药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35DCCEBBD6E771AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1210529025:1":{"text":"역시나... 해난 뒤에 블러디 로즈의 평판은 급격히 좋아졌죠. 그리고 다들 당신을 대부라고 부르기도 하고요.","source_cn":"果然……海难后，血薇帮的人望迅速攀升，大家都尊称你为教父。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67AAE50BF54CC9AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1210529026:1":{"text":"이상하죠? 제가 어떻게 알았을까요?","source_cn":"奇怪我怎么知道的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D3F7E586E3F8348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1210529027:1":{"text":"잊지 마세요. 저를 가르친 건 당신이라는 걸요.","source_cn":"别忘了，你把我教的很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8F6B7ABB8AEA235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1210529028:1":{"text":"그게 뭐 어때서? 난 그들에게 새로운 생명을 줬어... 내가 바로 그들의 구세주라고!","source_cn":"这有什么，我给了他们新的生命……我就是他们的救世主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C70FD60C0DFF760","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1210529029:1":{"text":"구세주의 도움은 공짜가 아니라는 걸 다들 알아야지!","source_cn":"所有人都应该知道，救世主的帮助不是无偿的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A7E8F9F3237A713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1210529030:1":{"text":"아무리 구세주라도 자기가 지은 죄는 자기가 갚아야죠.","source_cn":"救世主犯下罪孽也是要偿还的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE2EA5EF02A565C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1210529031:1":{"text":"내가 피로 블러디 로즈를 먹여 살린 게 잘못이라는 거냐? 꽃을 잘 피우려면 피 묻은 비료가 최고인 것을!","source_cn":"我用鲜血哺育血薇帮，有什么错呢？花要想开的好，沾血的肥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3A0B0C41AD4DC46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1210529032:1":{"text":"변명하지 마세요. 아버지는 심판을 받게 될 거예요.","source_cn":"别狡辩了，你会迎来审判。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3B2FB44EBA8536B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1210529033:1":{"text":"...심판?","source_cn":"……审判？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AA401EDA8F4FE0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1210529034:1":{"text":"아직은 아니라고!","source_cn":"还不到时候！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEAAE898129BCA93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:泰西欧":{"text":"테시오","source":"泰西欧","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":35,"localized_text_count":34,"speaker_count":4}}